      ['A job for pros or a dive center', 'Audits, instructor assessment, consulting.'],
    ],
    philosophyH: ['We take divers into caves.', 'Your first breath is in safe hands.'],
    philosophy:
      'DECOBROSCREW is a crew of technical divers from Novosibirsk. Decompression, caves and ice have taught us one thing: safety has no discounts — on an expedition or in a pool.',
    philosophyLink: 'Meet the Crew',
    pathEyebrow: 'The path from zero',
    pathH: 'From your first breath to a cave.',
    pathLead:
      'Nobody starts deep. Every step is taken with an instructor and to the international SDI and TDI standards.',
    path: [
      {
        meta: 'SDI Scuba Discovery',
        title: 'First breath',
        copy: 'About two hours with an instructor: in a pool (Spartak, Neptun) or in open water at Abrashino or Temir. No experience needed.',
        link: ['How it works', '/try'],
      },
      {
        meta: 'SDI Open Water Scuba Diver',
        title: 'Your own certificate',
        copy: 'Theory, pool and open water. The result is an international certification to dive with a buddy to 18 metres.',
        link: ['Open Water course', '/training#recreational'],
      },
      {
        meta: 'SDI Advanced · specialties',
        title: 'Experience and confidence',
        copy: 'Depth, night, navigation, dry suit. Then wrecks and expeditions.',
        link: ['Specialties', '/training#specialties'],
      },
      {
        meta: 'TDI',
        title: 'Technical diving',
        copy: 'Decompression, gas mixes, caves — our core specialty.',
        link: ['Technical training', '/training#technical'],
      },
    ],
    dreamsEyebrow: 'Where it leads',
    dreamsH: 'Saw it in a film? We know the way.',
    dreamsLead:
      'Every dream is a concrete route: which certification you need, how many dives, where to gain experience. We will plot it with you.',
    dreamsLink: 'How to get there',
    dreams: [
      ['Mantas', 'Maldives, liveaboard. You need a certification and a little experience.'],
      ['Shipwrecks', 'Red Sea. Advanced first, then inside.'],
      ['Cenotes and caves', 'Mexico. It starts with cavern, then TDI cave training.'],
      ['Under the ice', 'Siberia and Baikal — our home water. Ice dives with the crew.'],
    ],
    serviceEyebrow: 'Workshop',
    serviceH: 'We fix what you breathe from.',
    serviceCopy: 'Service and repair for every type of gear. Apeks service certification.',
    serviceList: [
      'Regulators',
      'BCDs and wings',
      'Dry, wet and semi-dry suits',
      'Cylinders — inspection through partners',
    ],
    serviceLink: 'Visit the workshop',
    proEyebrow: 'For pros and business',
    proH: 'An independent view from technical divers.',
    proCopy: 'For dive centers, clubs and professional divers.',
    proList: [
      'Dive center audit',
      'Instructor skills assessment',
      'Consulting and internal procedures',
      'Demanding dives and expeditions to order',
    ],
    proLink: 'Learn more',
    giftEyebrow: 'Gift certificate',
    giftH: ['Give someone', 'their first breath underwater.'],
    gift: 'For someone who has dreamed of it for years but never dared. A certificate for a try dive with an instructor — write to us and we will arrange it.',
    giftCta: 'Order a certificate',
  },
  zh: {
    description:
      'DECOBROSCREW 是来自新西伯利亚的水下解决方案团队：体验潜水、SDI 和 TDI 培训、探险、装备维修以及潜水中心审核。',
    hero: ['想去', '水下看看吗？'],
    heroCopy: ['体验、学习、与蝠鲼相遇。', '维修调节器、审核潜水中心。', '水下的一切，交给我们。'],
    heroCta: '首次体验潜水',
    heroSecondary: '我已经会潜水',
    wantEyebrow: '从哪里开始',
    wantH: '您想在水下做什么？',
    want: [
      ['第一次体验', '泳池或开放水域，教练全程在旁，无需经验。'],
      ['学习并获得证书', '从零开始的开放水域课程：理论、泳池、开放水域。'],
      ['潜得更深', '沉船、洞穴、减压潜水、冰潜。'],
      ['去看蝠鲼、沉船和天然井', '与团队同行、匹配您水平的探险。'],
      ['维修装备', '调节器、浮力控制装置、潜水服。Apeks 认证。'],
      ['专业潜水员或潜水中心的需求', '审核、教练评估、咨询。'],
    ],
    philosophyH: ['我们带潜水员进入洞穴。', '您的第一口水下呼吸，有我们守护。'],
    philosophy:
      'DECOBROSCREW 是来自新西伯利亚的技术潜水团队。减压潜水、洞穴和冰潜让我们明白一件事：安全从不打折——无论是在探险中，还是在泳池里。',
    philosophyLink: '认识团队',
    pathEyebrow: '从零开始的路径',
    pathH: '从第一口呼吸到洞穴。',
    pathLead: '没有人一开始就潜得很深。每一步都有教练陪同，并遵循 SDI 和 TDI 国际标准。',
    path: [
      {
        meta: 'SDI Scuba Discovery',
        title: '第一口呼吸',
        copy: '由教练陪同约两小时：在泳池（Spartak、Neptun）或阿布拉希诺、捷米尔的开放水域。无需经验。',
        link: ['体验流程', '/try'],
      },
      {
        meta: 'SDI Open Water Scuba Diver',
        title: '属于您的证书',
        copy: '理论、泳池和开放水域。结业获得国际认证，可与潜伴潜至 18 米。',
        link: ['开放水域课程', '/training#recreational'],
      },
      {
        meta: 'SDI Advanced · 专项课程',
        title: '经验与自信',
        copy: '深潜、夜潜、导航、干式潜水服。然后是沉船和探险。',
        link: ['专项课程', '/training#specialties'],
      },
      {
        meta: 'TDI',
        title: '技术潜水',
        copy: '减压、混合气体、洞穴——这是我们的核心专长。',
        link: ['技术潜水培训', '/training#technical'],
      },
    ],
    dreamsEyebrow: '它将带您去往',
    dreamsH: '在电影里见过？我们知道怎么去。',
    dreamsLead:
      '每个梦想都是一条具体的路线：需要什么证书、多少次潜水、在哪里积累经验。我们会和您一起规划。',
    dreamsLink: '如何到达',
    dreams: [
      ['蝠鲼', '马尔代夫船宿。需要证书和一些经验。'],
      ['沉船', '红海。先完成进阶课程，再进入船体。'],
      ['天然井与洞穴', '墨西哥。从半洞穴开始，然后是 TDI 洞穴培训。'],
      ['冰下潜水', '西伯利亚和贝加尔湖——我们的主场。与团队一起冰潜。'],
    ],
    serviceEyebrow: '装备维修',
    serviceH: '我们维修您赖以呼吸的装备。',
    serviceCopy: '各类潜水装备的保养与维修。Apeks 维修认证。',
    serviceList: [
      '调节器',
      '浮力控制装置与背飞',
      '干式、湿式和半干式潜水服',
      '气瓶——通过合作方检验',
    ],
    serviceLink: '前往维修',
    proEyebrow: '专业与企业服务',
    proH: '来自技术潜水员的独立视角。',
    proCopy: '面向潜水中心、俱乐部和专业潜水员。',
    proList: ['潜水中心审核', '教练技能评估', '咨询与内部流程', '按需定制的高难度潜水与探险'],
    proLink: '了解更多',
    giftEyebrow: '礼品卡',
    giftH: ['送出', '第一次水下呼吸。'],
    gift: '送给梦想已久却一直没有迈出第一步的人。体验潜水礼品卡，由教练全程陪同——联系我们，我们来安排。',
    giftCta: '订购礼品卡',
  },
}[locale];

const wantHrefs = [
  '/try',
  '/training#recreational',
  '/training#technical',
  '/expeditions',
  '/service',
  '/pro',
];
const dreamLinks = [
  ['D01', '/expeditions'],
  ['D02', '/expeditions'],
  ['D03', '/expeditions'],
  ['D04', '/contact'],
] as const;
---

<BaseLayout title="DECOBROSCREW" description={T.description} home>
  <Hero
    imageId="H01"
    compact
    lines={T.hero}
    copy={T.heroCopy}
    cta={{ label: T.heroCta, href: p('/try') }}
    secondary={{ label: T.heroSecondary, href: '#want' }}
  />

  <section id="want" class="section want" aria-labelledby="want-h">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">{T.wantEyebrow}</p>
      <h2 id="want-h">{T.wantH}</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <ol class="want-list" data-stagger>
        {T.want.map(([title, note], i) => (
          <li>
            <a href={p(wantHrefs[i])}>
              <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">
                {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
              </span>
              <span class="t">{title}</span>
              <span class="d">{note}</span>
              <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                →
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Band
    class="home-philosophy"
    id="philosophy"
    imageId="H02"
    position="center 22%"
    height="380px"
    mobileRatio="2 / 1"
  >
    <h2>
      {T.philosophyH[0]}
      <br />
      {T.philosophyH[1]}
    </h2>
    <span class="rule"></span>
    <p class="lead">{T.philosophy}</p>
    <a class="link-arrow" href={p('/crew')}>
      {T.philosophyLink} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </Band>

  <section class="section paper" aria-labelledby="path-h">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">{T.pathEyebrow}</p>
      <h2 id="path-h">{T.pathH}</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <p class="lead intro">{T.pathLead}</p>
      <Steps
        items={T.path.map((s) => ({
          meta: s.meta,
          title: s.title,
          copy: s.copy,
          link: { label: s.link[0], href: p(s.link[1]) },
        }))}
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="dreams-h">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">{T.dreamsEyebrow}</p>
      <h2 id="dreams-h">{T.dreamsH}</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <p class="lead intro">{T.dreamsLead}</p>
      <ul class="dreams" data-stagger>
        {T.dreams.map(([title, note], i) => (
          <li>
            <a class="dream zoom-media" href={p(dreamLinks[i][1])}>
              <EditorialImage
                imageId={dreamLinks[i][0]}
                sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw"
              />
              <h3>{title}</h3>
              <p>{note}</p>
              <span class="link-arrow">
                {T.dreamsLink} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services" aria-label={`${T.serviceEyebrow}, ${T.proEyebrow}`}>
    <div class="panel dark reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">{T.serviceEyebrow}</p>
      <h2>{T.serviceH}</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <p class="lead">{T.serviceCopy}</p>
      <ul>
        {T.serviceList.map((item) => (
          <li>{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <a class="link-arrow" href={p('/service')}>
        {T.serviceLink} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="panel paper reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">{T.proEyebrow}</p>
      <h2>{T.proH}</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <p class="lead">{T.proCopy}</p>
      <ul>
        {T.proList.map((item) => (
          <li>{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <a class="link-arrow" href={p('/pro')}>
        {T.proLink} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ClosingCta
    id="gift-h"
    eyebrow={T.giftEyebrow}
    heading={T.giftH}
    lead={T.gift}
    cta={{ label: T.giftCta, href: p('/contact') }}
    imageId="H03"
  />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .intro {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  /* "I want to…": an index of entry points, one hairline row each. */
  .want-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .want-list li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .want-list a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.5rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    grid-template-areas:
      'n t arrow'
      'n d arrow';
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px 12px;
    min-height: 72px;
    padding-block: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .want-list .n {
    grid-area: n;
    align-self: start;
    padding-top: 0.35em;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    /* Deep blue keeps AA contrast on paper as well as white. */
    color: #1f5f86;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .want-list .t {
    grid-area: t;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.6vw + 0.8rem, 1.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .want-list .d {
    grid-area: d;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .want-list .arrow {
    grid-area: arrow;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    transition: transform var(--motion-fast) var(--motion-ease);
  }
  .want-list a:hover .arrow,
  .want-list a:focus-visible .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .want-list a:hover .t {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }
  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .want-list a {
      grid-template-columns: 3.5rem minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      grid-template-areas: 'n t d arrow';
      gap: 24px;
      min-height: 88px;
    }
    .want-list .n {
      align-self: center;
